pply of Dollars to Curb Naira Volatility&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/nigeria-boosts-retail-supply-of-dollars-to-curb-naira-volatility</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:29:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 什么是“纹理最大化”？食品趋势将紧缩纳入菜单</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/texture-maxxing-food-trends-gen-z.html</link><description>质感最大化是最新的食品趋势，席卷了社交媒体，因为消费者在审美和口味的驱动下，现在也在寻找感官体验。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/texture-maxxing-food-trends-gen-z.html'&gt;什么是“纹理最大化”？食品趋势将紧缩纳入菜单&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：What is ‘texture-maxxing’? The food trend putting crunch on the menu&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/texture-maxxing-food-trends-gen-z.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:34:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 英国是最新报告柴油需求下滑的欧洲大型经济体</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-is-latest-big-european-economy-to-report-diesel-demand-slump</link><description>英国是最新一个报告柴油销售因中东和乌克兰冲突引发的天价高价而陷入困境的欧洲主要国家。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-is-latest-big-european-economy-to-report-diesel-demand-slump'&gt;英国是最新报告柴油需求下滑的欧洲大型经济体&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UK Is Latest Big European Economy to Report Diesel Demand Slump&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-is-latest-big-european-economy-to-report-diesel-demand-slump</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:51:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 能源交易商 BGN 最新扩张目标瞄准农业</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/energy-trader-bgn-targets-agriculture-in-latest-expansion-push</link><description>大宗商品贸易公司 BGN 正在进军农业领域，推动其在核心能源市场之外的全球快速扩张。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;