-what-s-keeping-ceos-up-at-night-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:20:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 仲量联行对这个假期的看法</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/what-jll-sees-this-holiday-season-video</link><description>JLL 的 2026 年假日零售报告发现，假日支出比去年增长 9.7%，越来越多的消费者将更多预算用于体验。仲量联行零售咨询服务总裁 Naveen Jaggi 在彭博市场上与 Stephen Carroll 讨论了假日购物趋势和零售房地产前景。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/what-jll-sees-this-holiday-season-video'&gt;仲量联行对这个假期的看法&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：What JLL Sees This Holiday Season&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/what-jll-sees-this-holiday-season-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:25:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 将数据带到感恩节餐桌上</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/1c91974e-8b52-4bd6-a9c3-fb42c1d02cf4?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>美国真的面临食品负担能力危机吗？&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/1c91974e-8b52-4bd6-a9c3-fb42c1d02cf4?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;将数据带到感恩节餐桌上&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bringing data to the Thanksgiving table&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/1c91974e-8b52-4bd6-a9c3-fb42c1d02cf4?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:26:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[路透社] 德国选择党联合领导人批评与俄罗斯特使的会谈计划</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPUG9BQjhLblpESUc5bkhXQVkyMjhQUVNJeTVSZHFZbE42Mi1NdGI4Q0o3US1mVlFNQzQ1Z244bGVhTkgtX0o3dDk1OTQwbFpLX0VIZGVnR2JpUHVmWENIQXEyTGZEemhzVGNNdFl0eEpvN0dYQ1oySm9aUHJMVDkyalBwOEdJdi1IbzFtSV9ZSmdOekZDcXFLaXl4SFd0ZFUzNk4wOVlxbVZXQnBhbjRjdjBLX1lIaGdOb0E?oc=5</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[路透社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPUG