osive Risk in Iowa, Evidence Suggests&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:00:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 刚果黄金交易商计划建设两座产能 68 吨的精炼厂</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity</link><description>刚果民主共和国的国家黄金贸易商计划建造两座产能为 68 吨的精炼厂，因为该国希望遏制走私并从其贵金属储备中获得更多利润。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity'&gt;刚果黄金交易商计划建设两座产能 68 吨的精炼厂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Congo Gold Trader Plans Two Refineries with 68-Ton Capacity&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:15:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 华尔街大肆进行套利交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6</link><description>行动主要针对 20% 的抵抗运动、干预和政治危机。啊霍拉，la volatilidad obliga a repensar una de las maniobras favorites del Mercado。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6'&gt;华尔街大肆进行套利交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Wall Street se vuelve más cauteloso con el carry trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:29:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[路透社] 特朗普表示，他要求普京“撤回”整个欧洲的军事侵略</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOLTBqZDFmdVZMYUhD